# Only hand-written seed inputs are checked in as reference corpus.
# Auto-discovered inputs from `cargo fuzz run` are local-only.
*
!.gitignore
!seed_*.toml
# Phase 120-02: a config-only (Shape A) server manifest carrying the new
# server layer media types and NO top-level artifactType. The target
# synthesizes structured manifests only by mutation, so this shape is
# effectively unreachable without a seed. Listed by name rather than under
# the `seed_*` glob because the phase plan and its acceptance criteria
# reference this exact path.
!config_only_manifest.json
